n":"Valley floor formed by combined fluvial and gravitational processes.","es":"Fondo de valle formado por procesos fluviales y gravitacionales combinados."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/glacis-de-cobertera-pedimento-cubierto-glacis-mixto","prefLabel":{"en":"covered glacis; covered pediment","es":"glacis de cobertera; pedimento cubierto; glacis mixto"},"definition":{"en":"A glacis covered by a thin mantle of sediments.","es":"Glacis cubierto por un manto delgado de sedimentos."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/glacis-de-erosion-pediment","prefLabel":{"en":"erosion glacis; pediment","es":"glacis de erosión; pediment"},"definition":{"en":"Gently inclined erosion surface at the foot of a relief.","es":"Superficie suavemente inclinada de erosión al pie de un relieve."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/glacis-de-vertiente-glacis-coluvial","prefLabel":{"en":"slope glacis; colluvial glacis","es":"glacis de vertiente; glacis coluvial"},"definition":{"en":"A glacis formed by colluvial deposits at the foot of a slope.","es":"Glacis formado por depósitos coluviales al pie de una vertiente."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/hombrera","prefLabel":{"en":"shoulder; bench","es":"hombrera; rellano"},"definition":{"en":"A subhorizontal surface interrupting a slope.","es":"Superficie subhorizontal que interrumpe una pendiente."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/hombrera-poligenetica","prefLabel":{"en":"shoulder; bench","es":"hombrera poligenética"},"definition":{"en":"A subhorizontal surface interrupting a slope.","es":"Superficie subhorizontal que interrumpe una pendiente."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/monte-isla-relieve-aislado-inselberg","prefLabel":{"en":"inselberg","es":"monte isla, relieve aislado; inselberg"},"definition":{"en":"Isolated steep-walled relief rising above a plain.","es":"Relieve aislado de paredes empinadas que se eleva sobre una llanura."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/monticulo-loma","prefLabel":{"en":"hillock; knoll","es":"montículo; loma"},"definition":{"en":"A small gentle terrain elevation.","es":"Pequeña elevación suave del terreno."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/otros-depositos","prefLabel":{"en":"other deposits","es":"otros depósitos"},"definition":{"en":"Deposits not classified in the previous categories.","es":"Depósitos no clasificados en las categorías anteriores."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/pico-principal-aguja-horn","prefLabel":{"en":"main peak; horn","es":"pico principal; aguja; horn"},"definition":{"en":"Sharp and prominent summit in a polygenetic relief.","es":"Cima aguda y prominente en un relieve poligénico."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/reborde-de-deposito-glacis","prefLabel":{"en":"deposit edge (glacis)","es":"reborde de depósito (glacis)"},"definition":{"en":"Edge of a glacis or piedmont deposit.","es":"Borde de un depósito de glacis o piedemonte."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/relieve-residual-monadnok","prefLabel":{"en":"residual relief; monadnock","es":"relieve residual; monadnok"},"definition":{"en":"Isolated relief rising above an erosion surface.","es":"Relieve aislado que sobresale de una superficie de erosión."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/superficie-de-cumbres-cresta-apalachiana","prefLabel":{"en":"summit surface; Appalachian ridge","es":"superficie de cumbres; cresta apalachiana"},"definition":{"en":"A summit surface maintaining a homogeneous altitude.","es":"Superficie de cumbres que mantiene una altitud homogénea."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/superficie-de-erosion","prefLabel":{"en":"erosion surface","es":"superficie de erosión"},"definition":{"en":"Geomorphologic landscapes and landforms related dominantly to water erosion but excluding perennial channel flow (i.e. fluvial, glaciofluvial) or eolian erosion.","es":"Paisajes geomorfológicos y formas del relieve relacionados predominantemente con la erosión del agua, con exclusión de las corrientes canalizadas perennes (es decir, fluviales, glaciofluviales), o a la erosión eólica."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/superficie-de-erosion-con-alterita","prefLabel":{"en":"erosion surface with alterite","es":"superficie de erosión con alterita"},"definition":{"en":"An erosion surface covered by residual weathering products.","es":"Superficie de erosión cubierta por productos de alteración residual."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/superficie-de-erosion-degradada","prefLabel":{"en":"degraded erosion surface","es":"superficie de erosión degradada"},"definition":{"en":"An erosion surface modified by subsequent erosional processes.","es":"Superficie de erosión modificada por procesos erosivos posteriores."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/superficie-de-erosion-poligenetica","prefLabel":{"en":"erosion surface","es":"superficie de erosión poligenética"},"definition":{"en":"A planation surface produced by prolonged erosion.","es":"Superficie de aplanamiento producida por erosión prolongada."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/techo-de-piedemonte-ranya","prefLabel":{"en":"piedmont surface; raña","es":"techo de piedemonte; raña"},"definition":{"en":"Culminating surface of a piedmont, often covered by coarse detrital deposits.","es":"Superficie culminante de un piedemonte, a menudo cubierta por depósitos detríticos gruesos."}}]},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/superficie-de-erosion-con-alterita","prefLabel":{"en":"erosion surface with alterite","es":"superficie de erosión con alterita"},"definition":{"en":"An erosion surface covered by residual weathering products.","es":"Superficie de erosión cubierta por productos de alteración residual."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/superficie-de-erosion-degradada","prefLabel":{"en":"degraded erosion surface","es":"superficie de erosión degradada"},"definition":{"en":"An erosion surface modified by subsequent erosional processes.","es":"Superficie de erosión modificada por procesos erosivos posteriores."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/superficie-de-erosion-poligenetica","prefLabel":{"en":"erosion surface","es":"superficie de erosión poligenética"},"definition":{"en":"A planation surface produced by prolonged erosion.","es":"Superficie de aplanamiento producida por erosión prolongada."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/superficie-de-erosion-con-alterita","prefLabel":{"en":"erosion surface with alterite","es":"superficie de erosión con alterita"},"definition":{"en":"An erosion surface covered by residual weathering products.","es":"Superficie de erosión cubierta por productos de alteración residual."}},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/superficie-de-erosion-degradada","prefLabel":{"en":"degraded erosion surface","es":"superficie de erosión degradada"},"definition":{"en":"An erosion surface modified by subsequent erosional processes.","es":"Superficie de erosión modificada por procesos erosivos posteriores."}}]},{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/techo-de-piedemonte-ranya","prefLabel":{"en":"piedmont surface; raña","es":"techo de piedemonte; raña"},"definition":{"en":"Culminating surface of a piedmont, often cover